      "help_en": "The ICCID of the IoT card.\n\nYou can find the ICCID on the IoT card, or view it on the Card Management page in the IoT SIM Service console (https://dyiotnext.console.aliyun.com/?spm=a2c4g.11186623.0.0.6a072d25p4pUg8)",
